## D.2 Transient Thermal Analysis

### D.2.1 Governing equation

\[
C \frac{dT}{dt} = Q_{\mathrm{in}} - Q_{\mathrm{out}}
\]

where \(C\) is the thermal capacitance (J/K).

### D.2.2 Steady-state solution

At steady state:

\[
Q_{\mathrm{in}} = Q_{\mathrm{out}} = \epsilon \sigma A_{\mathrm{rad}} (T^4 - T_{\mathrm{sink}}^4)
\]

