For small perturbations around steady state:

\[
\tau_{\mathrm{thermal}} = \frac{C}{4 \epsilon \sigma A_{\mathrm{rad}} T^3}
\]

For \(C = 100{,}000\) J/K, \(A_{\mathrm{rad}} = 25\) m², \(T = 300\) K:

