\[
H_0:
\phi_{\mathrm{phys}} < 0.10 \lor \Delta P_M < 0.05 \lor \frac{\Delta P_M}{O_{\mathrm{phys}}} < 0.01
\]

## Q.3 Statistical Test

\[
z = \frac{\hat\phi_{\mathrm{phys}} - 0.10}{\sqrt{0.10 \times 0.90 / N}}
\]

Reject \(H_0\) if \(z > 1.645\) (one-sided, \(\alpha = 0.05\)).

## Q.4 Power Analysis

For \(\phi_{\mathrm{phys}} = 0.15\), \(N = 987\) (exhaustive):

\[
z = \frac{0.15 - 0.10}{\sqrt{0.10 \times 0.90 / 987}} = \frac{0.05}{0.00955} = 5.24
\]

Power > 0.99.

## Q.5 Interpretation

- If \(H_0\) rejected: CRG-2 is justified for this mission.
- If \(H_0\) not rejected: CRG-2 is not justified; the negative result is publishable.

